WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Right, today we shoot a jungle gym vlog.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
It needs the wobble to feel real. Send more agents.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Skip the vibe. Tell me what one take costs.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Good news, we already priced that take.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Shake is per frame. Lower quality, same compute.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
It is still unrolling. It reached the treeline.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
All this for thirty seconds. We cannot even reshoot.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
About that shake. My hands just do that.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
No inference needed. Comes free.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
We render on our own cards. Then twenty takes is fine.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Not four dollars a clip. Just power. Wobble away.

